{"seq":3,"slug":"collaborative-ux","title":"协作 UX","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multiplayer-cursors","title":"多人光标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/multiplayer-cursors","wordCount":1738,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"selection-and-highlighting","title":"选择与高亮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/selection-and-highlighting","wordCount":1642,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"conflict-feedback","title":"冲突反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/conflict-feedback","wordCount":1939,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"permissions-and-roles","title":"权限与角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-ux/permissions-and-roles","wordCount":2170,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"协作-ux\">协作 UX</h1><p>协作体验让多人同时编辑不仅能用，还令人愉悦——多人光标（看到他人正在哪里输入）、共享选区与高亮（看到他人选中了什么）、冲突反馈（自己的编辑与他人的编辑合并要细腻）、权限与角色（所有者、编辑者、查看者）、用户身份（头像、配色）。Figma 是业界标杆——带名字与配色的光标、看到他人的选区、实时编辑非常流畅。Liveblocks 预制的 React Hooks 让构建这些功能变得简单。本章覆盖多人光标的实施、选区共享、冲突反馈体验、权限模型。学完本章你能搭建类似 Figma 的协作光标与选区、设计权限模型（所有者 / 编辑者 / 评论者 / 查看者）、优雅地处理冲突。</p>\n"}